# MatchVaga Project Overview

## Product

**MatchVaga** is a SaaS platform that:
1. **Analyzes the gap** between a user's resume and a job description
2. **Identifies missing skills** required for the target role
3. **Generates an optimized document** (PDF/DOCX) tailored to the job

## Tech Stack

| Layer | Technology |
|-------|------------|
| Framework | Next.js 16 (App Router) |
| React | React 19 |
| Styling | Tailwind CSS v4 |
| UI Components | shadcn/ui (radix-vega style), Base UI, Radix UI |
| Icons | lucide-react |
| Utils | clsx, tailwind-merge, class-variance-authority |

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/           # App Router pages, layouts, route groups
├── components/    # Feature components + ui/ (shadcn primitives)
├── contexts/      # React Context providers
├── hooks/         # Custom hooks (logic layer)
├── lib/           # Utilities (cn, etc.)
└── types/         # Shared TypeScript interfaces
```

## Route Architecture

| Route Group | Layout | Purpose |
|-------------|--------|---------|
| `(auth)/` | Full-screen, brand primary override | Login (email → token flow) |
| `(legal)/` | Minimal `bg-background` wrapper | Privacy policy, Terms of service |
| `onboarding/` | Top bar + step indicator | Resume upload → verify flow |
| `dashboard/` | *(TBD — sidebar layout)* | Main app after onboarding |

Route groups `(auth)` and `(legal)` use parenthesized folders to share layouts without affecting the URL.

## Path Aliases

- `@/components` — Components
- `@/components/ui` — shadcn UI primitives
- `@/contexts` — Context providers
- `@/hooks` — Custom hooks
- `@/lib` — Lib utilities
- `@/lib/utils` — cn() helper
- `@/types` — Shared type definitions

